WEBVTT

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:06.040
Doctor, she doesn't seem that powerful.

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:09.710
To think someone of her level
is the Witchblade wearer...

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.340
Yes. She's less than I had thought.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.720
Shall I try attacking her?

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.140
What's going on, you two?!

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:22.140
Let's leave for today. We can
always test out her abilities later.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.560
Understood.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.650
What does this mean?!

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:45.560
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:49.150
I shout out countless times, break out

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:54.340
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.630
Hot blood flows through my body

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:03.340
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:09.940
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.440
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:20.980
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:24.490
Uncontrollable impulses

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:31.410
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:38.630
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:45.630
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:48.810
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:55.380
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:01:59.160 --> 00:01:59.630
You made contact with them
earlier than I had anticipated.

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:01.700
"Search"

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:07.830
Who were they? All I know
is I don't like the likes of them.

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:10.620
I'm sure you've heard of NSWF.

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:13.920
Isn't it like the boss of
the Child Welfare Department?

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:18.840
"Boss"? That puts non-profits
around the world at a loss.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:23.600
Segawa, tell her about the Cloneblades.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:24.680
Yes, sir.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.350
Cloneblades?

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:34.020
Douji Industries and NSWF once
shared technological information.

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:36.730
We succeeded in creating "Cloneblades,"

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:41.950
a fusion of our Witchblade research
and the NSWF's biotechnology.

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:45.870
They're somewhat inferior to the original,

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:49.620
but their basic structure is
the same as the Witchblade's.

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.710
So those two women were...

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:54.460
Members of the NSWF's Neo-Gene pool,

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:58.170
who were particularly
suitable to wear Cloneblades.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.090
Neo-Gene?

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:02.760
A species born from biotechnology.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:05.890
The one you encountered is named "Lady,"

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:08.680
and is the most advanced Neo-Gene.

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:12.730
We have no info on the other woman,
but she is quite high-level too,

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:15.860
judging from how she crushed the X-Cons.

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:20.440
Hold on! Did you hire them
to exterminate X-Cons too?!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:24.700
No, we haven't collaborated
technology with NSWF for six years.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:27.870
Then why were they doing battle?

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:31.790
It's because of how I-Weapons work.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:34.170
As they seek stronger opponents,

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:37.380
they prefer Neo-Genes over regular people.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:40.800
It's the same reason
the Witchblade craves battle.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:43.970
You've surely sensed it yourself.

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:46.640
You, of all people,
should be able to empathize.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:51.850
The other factor we must be careful
of is NSWF's director, Furumizu.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.770
He wants the Witchblade.

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:55.900
How come?

00:03:55.980 --> 00:04:00.030
Because putting the real Witchblade
on the most advanced Neo-Gene

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:02.820
will create the most powerful human ever.

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:09.330
This is just a rumor,
but I heard his Dept. of Child Welfare

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:12.750
is just a cover to select Neo-Genes
from a prime field of candidates.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.920
What?! Are you saying he's using the children?!

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:20.460
Probably. So make sure you
never join hands with NSWF.

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:23.920
Of course not! I never liked them, anyway.

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:26.840
If you understand, then leave.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:30.720
Hold on. About this
money I got the other day...

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:35.020
It's for your living expenses.
We'll give you some from time to time.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:38.110
I don't like how that makes you my keeper.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:41.860
The way I want it is like this:
I work and then get paid.

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.900
If that's how you want it...

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:47.910
So I'm taking this as payment
for the job I did earlier!

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:51.330
In that case, you haven't
done any work for us this time.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:52.910
So you get nothing.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:58.460
I went to the scene! You recovered them,
so I deserve a percentage!

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:04.840
I hired you to eliminate X-Cons.
I will pay for no other work.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.630
I'll just take 30%.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:09.800
Did you not hear me? No payment.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:13.890
For someone rolling in the dough,
you sure are a tightwad!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:16.390
Being cheap'll make you bald, you know!

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.730
And your hairline already looks pretty iffy!

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:20.980
Masane-san, I think that's enough...

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:25.900
Fine! Then pay me for the very
first job I did at the detention center!

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:29.030
That was before we hired you...
But I defeated the monster!

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:32.910
Fine. Segawa, pay the woman.

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:34.700
Thanks for the business!

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:38.420
And I don't need this guy
as my bodyguard anymore.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:43.800
My goodness! You put me on
pins and needles, Masane-san...

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.760
I just spoke the truth.

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:50.470
But that was the first time
I've ever seen him concede.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:53.260
Really? By the way, how much does a job pay?

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:56.520
You negotiated without knowing that?

00:05:56.600 --> 00:06:00.020
I'm thinking 1 00,000 to 1 50,000?

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.900
What do you take Douji for?

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:07.740
It's the same as what our top
lab researchers get... over two million.

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:09.820
What?! Two million?!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.110
Shh!

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.830
I can't believe that woman...

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:21.790
Lower illumination.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.130
To think the Witchblade would
choose someone like her...

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:30.550
Yes?

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.760
It's time for the board of directors meeting.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:41.560
You're one minute and
thirty seconds late... Takayama-kun.

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:48.150
This is it.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:50.490
Wow!

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:55.530
Come here, Mom!

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:58.540
It has a real kitchen!

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:01.790
Yeah! You can do lots of cooking now, Riko!

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:04.000
Yeah!

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:08.340
The following month's rent
is due at the end of the month.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:10.420
I'll take 35,000 for
this month's prorated rent.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:12.220
Hold on!

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:16.760
Chou-san said it's 60,000 a month!
Half a month comes to 30,000!

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:19.810
It's a surcharge for the kid.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:21.310
Say what?!

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.730
If you don't like it, then leave.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:25.110
Cheapskate!
Sticks and stones...

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:30.900
Tadaa! Sorry to keep
you waiting, everybody!

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:33.320
Here's a loving housewarming
gift from ol' Chou-san!

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:35.240
Wow! Futons!

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:37.830
Thank you so much! It'll come in handy!

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.200
And this...

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:42.910
We all use the public bathhouse
since we don't have a bath here.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.620
Care to join me?

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:47.170
I want to go! Can we, Mom?

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:47.960
Sure!

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.920
That reminds me, Kei-Chan at the bathhouse

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:54.760
said you went in the women's side
again, pretending you were senile!

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.890
I have no recollection of that.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:01.930
Okay, it's bath time! Come on, you two!

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.730
Oh, coming!

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.900
See you later!
Yeah.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.360
I don't know...

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:14.700
Click!

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:19.870
I've never been to a
bathhouse before! I'm so excited!

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:21.910
Me, too!

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:29.380
Yo! Looking studly today!

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:34.880
This is Michael, he lives on the roof.
Recently got a job at some office.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.130
An office?

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:38.350
Nice to meet you, Michael-san!

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:46.100
Care to bathe with us, Naomi-san?

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.400
"Naomi-san"!

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:48.810
Naomi-san...

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:54.190
Naomi-bou is shy, so she always
goes in the morning. Right?

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.320
Yes.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:58.870
If Tozawa-Chan were here,
then that'd make all of us!

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:01.540
Is Tozawa the guy Riko first met?

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:06.460
Yep! But he hasn't come home lately.
Maybe he got himself a woman?

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:14.340
Damn that geezer Nakata,
throwing me in the slammer!

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:19.800
Has it gotten colder?

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.600
Do we put both our clothes in here?

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.770
Yeah.
Okay.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.360
Say, Mom...

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.440
What is it, Riko?
Tiptoe... silently... creeping...

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:36.990
Have you gained weight?

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:38.950
What?! You think so?!
Tiptoe... silently... creeping...

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:42.830
I haven't weighed myself lately.
I like my women with fat on them!

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:46.040
I don't wanna get cold! Let's get in!

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:48.290
Okay!
Ever so silently...

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:50.040
You perverted geezer!

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:55.630
It's so big in here!
We could go swimming!

00:09:55.720 --> 00:10:00.340
No. There was a sign out front
that said we aren't supposed to swim.

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:02.180
Yeah, I know.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:05.890
But I like this place! Let's come every day!

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:10.020
Yeah! Say, wanna go shopping tomorrow?

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:14.900
Yeah! We have to buy
kitchenware first, like sharp knives and

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:17.650
I don't mean that stuff. What about clothes?

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:22.280
You buy them. You need
to be a little more feminine!

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:26.830
Okay, okay! Understood, Princess Rihoko!

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.670
Stop it, Mom!

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:32.920
Next is my shower attack!

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.710
I see... So she has a child. A daughter?

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:39.760
Yes, about six years old.

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:44.430
I see. That's all the information I need.
You can come back now.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:45.350
Understood.

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:55.110
It couldn't be...

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:44.780
It's still... not enough.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:00.420
Yo...

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:03.170
Oh. You're alive.

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:06.760
I'm beat... Nobody can
sleep in that kind of place.

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:08.050
What kind of place?

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:11.020
Mariko-san, food, please...

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:14.730
Sheesh! How can you make a living like that?

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:16.560
I hope you're okay with something simple.

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:20.780
Good morning!

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:26.740
Huh? What're you doing here?
I thought you ran away?

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:30.370
I moved in here yesterday with my mom!

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:31.490
Yeah?

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:35.870
I hear you helped Rihoko! Thank you so much!

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:40.040
I'm her mother, Amaha Masane.
Nice to meet you!

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:43.510
Oh... Masamune-san?

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.180
Masa... mune?
[Masa: serious; Mune: chest]

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.590
That's a good one.

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:48.850
You do have big boobs, Mom!

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:53.430
It's perfect! Ma-sa-mu-ne.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:56.440
It's Masane! Ma-sa-ne!

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:59.770
You're the one that disappeared
from the detention center!

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:04.860
I was looking for you!
Your daughter asked me to help!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:08.620
Tell me, did you see anything there?!

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:11.740
No... I didn't see anything...

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:15.120
No, I can tell you know something.

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:19.830
Tell me! Please! I'm begging you! C'mon!

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:24.010
Let go! Stop being weird!

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:27.010
Hey!
I didn't see anything!

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:28.970
Riko, let's go shopping!
Okay!

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:35.890
Don't harass my mom! Let's go!

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:41.860
Something happen at the detention center?

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:45.900
That's an understatement.
So that's why you haven't slept.

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:49.660
You mean me?! No, no, no!
You've got it all wrong!

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:52.120
Where's my food already, Mariko-san?

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:59.870
Tadah!

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.960
I think I'll do the choosing.

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:05.550
Hold on a sec!
Okay.

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:13.640
I'm afraid we don't carry your cup size here...

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:17.640
Maybe I'll just go bra-less...
No!

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:18.810
They'll droop.

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:21.600
Hey! Let's get this!
Don't need it.

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:32.530
I'm pooped...

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:35.790
We forgot to buy aprons! I'll go buy some!

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:40.290
Kids have so much energy...

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:43.790
Yo! Have some.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:44.500
Just what do you think

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:50.590
Name's Tozawa Yuusuke.
I'm a freelance journalist... well, almost.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:54.390
I make money by following up on leads.

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:57.180
I don't have any scoops for you.

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:58.390
No?

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:03.810
What's this?

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:08.990
So you did see it... the monster.

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:11.740
Monster?

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:17.200
You were there, so you had
to have seen it. Am I wrong?

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:40.220
C'mon. How long're you gonna stay silent?

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:42.190
At least throw me a bone here...

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:46.810
I already told you, I don't know anything.
Thanks for the coffee.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:47.690
Masamune-san!

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:50.820
It's Masane. Ma-sa-ne!

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.150
My bad.

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.410
And don't bother tailing me anymore!

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:56.740
Mom!

00:15:56.830 --> 00:16:01.040
Oh! Why is Tozawa-san here?

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:04.870
Just by coincidence! Now let's go home!

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:05.790
Okay...

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.880
I bought matching aprons!

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:09.210
Yeah?

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:12.760
Maybe I should do some cooking, too!
This isn't the last you've seen of me...

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:18.050
Sir, I don't see why you
need to attend a charity party

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:21.350
thrown by rich people
with too much free time...

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:24.350
I pulled the short straw
at the directors meeting.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:28.020
But I'm sure you'll be popular
with the lady stockholders.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.190
Rubbish.

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:40.120
I see. So you made contact
with the Witchblade wearer.

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:43.370
It seems Douji has indeed obtained it.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:47.290
And the wearer? What kind of woman is she?

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.840
It's nothing to concern yourself over.

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:54.340
I know you would be disappointed
if you met her, Father.

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:56.260
How deplorable.

00:16:56.340 --> 00:17:01.640
I heard that one of the sisters is missing.
Was it an X-Con again?

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:08.810
Most likely, although Douji claims
the X-Con leak was an accident.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:12.690
Regardless, you just continue
working on the Witchblade.

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:17.360
There's a party tonight, isn't there?

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:21.660
Yes, though you aren't scheduled to attend...

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:24.830
No, I'll be attending.

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:47.190
Oh, Takayama-san!
How unusual to see you at a party!

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:48.440
Nice to see you.

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.730
Let me introduce you to someone new!

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:53.320
This is the president of FB Pharmaceuticals!

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:56.820
His stock doubled after introducing
a new hair regrowth drug!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:05.660
Riko... We finally have a home!

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:10.290
Yes?

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:13.460
This is Ota, from the retrieval team.
We've spotted an X-Con.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:14.500
Got it.

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:17.970
I'll be back!

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.310
Yes.

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:32.310
Takayama-sama.

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:35.900
Furumizu is here. He requests your audience,

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:38.780
if you don't
Such things must first be
cleared through his secretary.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:40.860
What do you say?

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:42.320
All right.

00:18:42.410 --> 00:18:43.450
Sir...

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:49.330
I've acquired some rare wine.
Would you like some?

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:52.540
No, thank you.

00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:59.260
It's been six years...

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:04.890
Yes, six years since the Witchblade
vanished from our sight.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:08.770
It was your daughter who got rid of it.

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:11.690
Yes, but it is in your hands now.

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:13.860
Where did you hear this groundless rumor?

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:16.320
Let us stop beating around the bush.

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:22.820
Both the Cloneblades and I-Weapons
were born of our collaboration.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:26.580
The NSWF should have
no need for the Witchblade.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:33.710
So you still insist it belongs to you?

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:37.500
Yes. It belongs to Douji.

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:43.840
It's close by!

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:06.700
Only one can wear the Witchblade.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:10.700
Furthermore, it is the Witchblade
that chooses who wears it.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:17.750
I do believe it was my
daughter whom it chose first.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:24.180
With all due respect, the Witchblade has
changed hands many times in the past.

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:27.220
Yes, changing hands...

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:31.020
Might your X-Cons be because you feared that?

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:33.180
Are you serious with that accusation?

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:38.610
A crown always returns to sit
on the head of the deserving.

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:42.780
Indeed... But only after
you kill the current king.

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:47.740
It's the first time I'm satisfied...

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:50.700
Well... I'm not satisfied!

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.750
She's not as powerful as we thought.

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:59.960
Likely due to the wearer.

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:03.880
Allow me, Doctor.

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:14.600
Let's see what you got, Witchblade.

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:16.600
You guys piss me off!

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:35.580
No way!

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:39.330
I can't believe it's Masamune!

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:07.280
I murmur, "I love you," with all my emotion

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.620
All my feelings until yesterday now overflow and dissolve quickly

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:28.550
If only this one last prayer could make it through...

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:37.390
Thank you for giving us the words to ascertain each other, God

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:49.400
Tomorrow, we'll reach out and hold hands harder than normal

00:22:49.490 --> 00:23:02.420
Tomorrow, we'll reach out, hug, kiss, and love each other

00:23:12.470 --> 00:23:15.890
I'm sorry, Riko. I know you're worried.

00:23:15.970 --> 00:23:18.430
I want to hurry home, too,

00:23:18.520 --> 00:23:23.400
but I'm so busy with work... Sort of.

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:25.270
I'm not even enjoying myself

00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:27.020
even though I'm on a luxury cruiser.

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:28.570
Your cooking is way better

00:23:28.650 --> 00:23:30.820
than what I'm having here, too.

00:23:30.900 --> 00:23:33.780
But I have to do my best to make money...

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:36.160
For our future.

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:39.370
Make sure you lock the door. Wait for me.
